{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年7月19日 09:20 星期日</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>【09:15】天文台特別天氣提示：位於珠江口以南的強雷雨區正逐漸靠近本港，預料未來兩三小時本港部分地區雨勢較大及有狂風雷暴。</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-19T02:18:02.638482+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none"}}